cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use omiprep, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "omiprep: Omics data preparation and processing pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An R package that reads raw Metabolon, Nightingale Health, Olink, and SomaLogic
  files (or flat text), and provides pre-analytical quality control, batch normalisation,
  summarisation, and reporting for metabolomics and proteomics data sets.
  Formerly known as metaboprep.
